Handle multicast lookup and update failures without retaining stale firmware rules.
Keep errno-bearing counts and update results signed, retire an old rule if its
new hierarchy cannot be allocated, and continue IPv6 group traversal after one
connection rejects an update. This is required by whole-group QinQ fallback.

